(4745476, 683410, 82503, '<td valign="top">I knew there would be a dog! Someone always submits their dog.<br/> <br/>What I don''t like about your picture is the fact that there is no real connection between the mask and the dog. It looks like the mask had just been put in front of it. Had the mask been somehow attached to the dog''s head, and had maybe been pulled back to reveal his face (or fallen off because of a strap that tore or something similar) there would have been this connection, a story. And you could have seen that the dog had actually been wearing the mask. Such a picture would have gotten a very high rating from me.</td>', 'I knew there would be a dog! Someone always submits their dog. What I don''t like about your picture is the fact that there is no real connection between the mask and the dog. It looks like the mask had just been put in front of it. Had the mask been somehow attached to the dog''s head, and had maybe been pulled back to reveal his face (or fallen off because of a strap that tore or something similar) there would have been this connection, a story. And you could have seen that the dog had actually been wearing the mask. Such a picture would have gotten a very high rating from me.', '2008-06-03 15:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
