(4752103, 683692, 87502, '<td valign="top">great effort - since this was an advanced editing you could have really cleaned up a few smudges (on the lip and right forehead) I personally would have matted both the black and white to a really flat finish, then brought the whiteness of your eyes up.  It''s a great photo but it''s not a home run for me. best of luck.</td>', 'great effort - since this was an advanced editing you could have really cleaned up a few smudges (on the lip and right forehead) I personally would have matted both the black and white to a really flat finish, then brought the whiteness of your eyes up.  It''s a great photo but it''s not a home run for me. best of luck.', '2008-06-05 16:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
