(4753845, 684704, 8624, '<td valign="top">great tones. I''m not that crazy about the pose - her face is so lovely and eyes so sharp that I want to see more rather than justa profile.</td>', 'great tones. I''m not that crazy about the pose - her face is so lovely and eyes so sharp that I want to see more rather than justa profile.', '2008-06-06 11:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
