(4753852, 683692, 8624, '<td valign="top">love the face painting and the crop and the pose. I wish the highlights weren''t quite so strong on the forehead and under the eye. while it does help shape the head and face, I find it just a little too harsh.</td>', 'love the face painting and the crop and the pose. I wish the highlights weren''t quite so strong on the forehead and under the eye. while it does help shape the head and face, I find it just a little too harsh.', '2008-06-06 11:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
