(4753859, 684504, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and showing the man behind the mask. I would like to see more of the body tho, so the head wasn''t just floating in space</td>', 'I like the pose and showing the man behind the mask. I would like to see more of the body tho, so the head wasn''t just floating in space', '2008-06-06 11:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
