(4755302, 684575, 76430, '<td valign="top">This mask in facinating.  It looks like it has two silhouette faces on the sides.  Good composition with the "fire" behind.  What is it really?</td>', 'This mask in facinating.  It looks like it has two silhouette faces on the sides.  Good composition with the "fire" behind.  What is it really?', '2008-06-07 02:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755305, 684225, 76430, '<td valign="top">This looks really overprocessed, nearly posterized.  Maybe you intended it that way, but it''s not to my liking.  I would really like to see this without all the processing.  I think I would really like it, especially if the feet were included.</td>', 'This looks really overprocessed, nearly posterized.  Maybe you intended it that way, but it''s not to my liking.  I would really like to see this without all the processing.  I think I would really like it, especially if the feet were included.', '2008-06-07 02:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
