(4755480, 684604, 12611, '<td valign="top">The good news is that the blue tape came off so easily. I like the tones- teh composition is ok, the whole thing may be a bit too grainy. good luck.</td>', 'The good news is that the blue tape came off so easily. I like the tones- teh composition is ok, the whole thing may be a bit too grainy. good luck.', '2008-06-07 08:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755482, 684528, 12611, '<td valign="top">fantastically intriguiing. this has that great feeling of antiquity, mystery, and romance. great shot.</td>', 'fantastically intriguiing. this has that great feeling of antiquity, mystery, and romance. great shot.', '2008-06-07 08:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755483, 684554, 12611, '<td valign="top">chilling in its negative effect. perhaps the coposition is a bit tall out of proportion, but its creepy, and thats great.</td>', 'chilling in its negative effect. perhaps the coposition is a bit tall out of proportion, but its creepy, and thats great.', '2008-06-07 08:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755484, 684570, 12611, '<td valign="top">I am not sure about the title, but the khaki theme is excellent here. The graininess adds to the shot. good composition as well.</td>', 'I am not sure about the title, but the khaki theme is excellent here. The graininess adds to the shot. good composition as well.', '2008-06-07 08:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755485, 683954, 12611, '<td valign="top">Is that Bill clinton- your a few years too late. And, if you want to call politicians the devil, stick to republicans- they fit a bit better- say Nixon, Reagan or Bush, or ...Cheney? anyway- great shot! super lighting and expression.</td>', 'Is that Bill clinton- your a few years too late. And, if you want to call politicians the devil, stick to republicans- they fit a bit better- say Nixon, Reagan or Bush, or ...Cheney? anyway- great shot! super lighting and expression.', '2008-06-07 08:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755486, 684704, 12611, '<td valign="top">A great warmth to this shot- gerat depth of black- super glow and the focus is a bit soft- which ultimately compliments the shot. Best of luck with this one.</td>', 'A great warmth to this shot- gerat depth of black- super glow and the focus is a bit soft- which ultimately compliments the shot. Best of luck with this one.', '2008-06-07 08:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755492, 682467, 12611, '<td valign="top">So post apocalyptic industrial. Great color scheme and use of like colors. nice soft focus. great shot. well above average.</td>', 'So post apocalyptic industrial. Great color scheme and use of like colors. nice soft focus. great shot. well above average.', '2008-06-07 08:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755736, 684225, 3020, '<td valign="top">Cute picture but I would have liked it without the extra processing and also a bit brighter.</td>', 'Cute picture but I would have liked it without the extra processing and also a bit brighter.', '2008-06-07 11:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755738, 684487, 3020, '<td valign="top">Took me a couple seconds to figure out what I was looking at. :) Cute image, seems a bit soft but good color though.</td>', 'Took me a couple seconds to figure out what I was looking at. :) Cute image, seems a bit soft but good color though.', '2008-06-07 11:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755741, 684590, 3020, '<td valign="top">Very interesting tribal/Mayan feeling to this. Like the lighting and tone. Two things distract me however; 1) Where as one eye-hole appears to be hollow, the other appears to be black, giving the impression the other should be white. 2) the feathers or hair going behind the mask, it looks cut off and my first impression was it was poorly edited before I noticed the outline of the mask.</td>', 'Very interesting tribal/Mayan feeling to this. Like the lighting and tone. Two things distract me however; 1) Where as one eye-hole appears to be hollow, the other appears to be black, giving the impression the other should be white. 2) the feathers or hair going behind the mask, it looks cut off and my first impression was it was poorly edited before I noticed the outline of the mask.', '2008-06-07 11:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755756, 684029, 3020, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh. Clarity and contrast are good as is the color. The hand is a bit distracting to me, seems to be the actual subject not the mask. Also the lighting hotspot on her neck is a bit distracting. Finally, that single white speck on the mask above the eye. :( otherwise a perfect photo.</td>', 'Nice bokeh. Clarity and contrast are good as is the color. The hand is a bit distracting to me, seems to be the actual subject not the mask. Also the lighting hotspot on her neck is a bit distracting. Finally, that single white speck on the mask above the eye. :( otherwise a perfect photo.', '2008-06-07 11:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755767, 684678, 3020, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure where the mask is in this photo compared to the blank face. However it is a nice photo, sharp, subject is very noticeable. The shirt is a little hard to notice against the trees. If you use Photoshop and haven''t you should try playing around with Image-&gt;Adjustments-&gt;Black and White... it allows you to shift the colors before converting to black and white and can increase the contrast between two colors.</td>', 'I''m not sure where the mask is in this photo compared to the blank face. However it is a nice photo, sharp, subject is very noticeable. The shirt is a little hard to notice against the trees. If you use Photoshop and haven''t you should try playing around with Image->Adjustments->Black and White... it allows you to shift the colors before converting to black and white and can increase the contrast between two colors.', '2008-06-07 11:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755773, 684429, 3020, '<td valign="top">No fair hiding behind your notepad. This is a very, unusual photo lol. Skin seems a bit orange, maybe too much saturation overall. Background seems more in focus than the foreground.</td>', 'No fair hiding behind your notepad. This is a very, unusual photo lol. Skin seems a bit orange, maybe too much saturation overall. Background seems more in focus than the foreground.', '2008-06-07 11:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755781, 684597, 3020, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and she seems like a lovely model. I like the transparency of the fabric. However most of it seems out of focus. Good color and great bokeh.</td>', 'I like the idea and she seems like a lovely model. I like the transparency of the fabric. However most of it seems out of focus. Good color and great bokeh.', '2008-06-07 11:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755786, 684606, 3020, '<td valign="top">Initially this didn''t have much impact on me. However not understanding the title I googled it and after learning its meaning the image seems much stronger. Let the good times roll indeed! Good color, red seems a little overblown (not uncommon with bright images), focus on the mask could be a little sharper. Odd bokeh effect with the reflections on the yellow beads is a little distracting.</td>', 'Initially this didn''t have much impact on me. However not understanding the title I googled it and after learning its meaning the image seems much stronger. Let the good times roll indeed! Good color, red seems a little overblown (not uncommon with bright images), focus on the mask could be a little sharper. Odd bokeh effect with the reflections on the yellow beads is a little distracting.', '2008-06-07 12:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755791, 684554, 3020, '<td valign="top">The mask itself is nice, I like the green. However I''m not a fan of the inversion process (guessing it is a gradient map against the black and white?). The white hair is distracting me, then my eyes get pulled down to the reversed shadows in the hand, making it seem almost like a light is coming from the base of the fan they are trying to cover up. :)</td>', 'The mask itself is nice, I like the green. However I''m not a fan of the inversion process (guessing it is a gradient map against the black and white?). The white hair is distracting me, then my eyes get pulled down to the reversed shadows in the hand, making it seem almost like a light is coming from the base of the fan they are trying to cover up. :)', '2008-06-07 12:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755819, 684728, 29009, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the lighting on the background to frame the focal point.</td>', 'Nice job with the lighting on the background to frame the focal point.', '2008-06-07 12:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755829, 683938, 29009, '<td valign="top">A more dramatic perspective may have worked a little better here.</td>', 'A more dramatic perspective may have worked a little better here.', '2008-06-07 12:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755832, 684684, 3020, '<td valign="top">Not technically a mask but I don''t care. Not much I can say against this one. Only thing I would have liked is if she seemed a little more, happy but it could just be the angle.</td>', 'Not technically a mask but I don''t care. Not much I can say against this one. Only thing I would have liked is if she seemed a little more, happy but it could just be the angle.', '2008-06-07 12:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755838, 684737, 29009, '<td valign="top">It''s a good idea, but the focal point lacks context with the obvious studio background.</td>', 'It''s a good idea, but the focal point lacks context with the obvious studio background.', '2008-06-07 12:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755839, 684677, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is a unique idea; something about the processing falls short for me.  Perhaps less orange and more sepia on the skin tones?  An extra point for creativity, tho!  :)</td>', 'This is a unique idea; something about the processing falls short for me.  Perhaps less orange and more sepia on the skin tones?  An extra point for creativity, tho!  :)', '2008-06-07 12:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755844, 684543, 29009, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done; a shame that the eye looks a bit fake.  Overall, a very strong shot.</td>', 'Beautifully done; a shame that the eye looks a bit fake.  Overall, a very strong shot.', '2008-06-07 12:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755849, 684604, 29009, '<td valign="top">I''m sensing either a subtle message I''m just not getting, or a last-minute "I don''t have a real mask" shoehorn shot.  I''ll give the benefit of the doubt here because the technicals are done well and the idea to show the winding of the tape instead of just a static "here''s my tape job" was good.</td>', 'I''m sensing either a subtle message I''m just not getting, or a last-minute "I don''t have a real mask" shoehorn shot.  I''ll give the benefit of the doubt here because the technicals are done well and the idea to show the winding of the tape instead of just a static "here''s my tape job" was good.', '2008-06-07 12:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755851, 684534, 29009, '<td valign="top">Clever processing - a very fun shot!  Well done.</td>', 'Clever processing - a very fun shot!  Well done.', '2008-06-07 12:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755857, 684599, 29009, '<td valign="top">Perhaps next time you could consider having the dog in motion or some other way to tell the "mystery dog" story.  Yeah, you''re in focus and the technicals are done fairly well with regard to the "rules" but there is nothing super captivating about this on an emotional level.</td>', 'Perhaps next time you could consider having the dog in motion or some other way to tell the "mystery dog" story.  Yeah, you''re in focus and the technicals are done fairly well with regard to the "rules" but there is nothing super captivating about this on an emotional level.', '2008-06-07 12:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755861, 684685, 29009, '<td valign="top">Clever idea - using the familiar message to reinforce a warning of danger was excellent.</td>', 'Clever idea - using the familiar message to reinforce a warning of danger was excellent.', '2008-06-07 12:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755862, 684684, 29009, '<td valign="top">Very well done - excellent use of DOF and composition here.</td>', 'Very well done - excellent use of DOF and composition here.', '2008-06-07 12:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755863, 684673, 3020, '<td valign="top">Well, there is a mask, and a model. Scene is too dark while the mask seems to be too bright in spots. Overall fuzzy, background seems lighter than the foreground. Sorry for the criticisms, please don''t get discouraged. :)</td>', 'Well, there is a mask, and a model. Scene is too dark while the mask seems to be too bright in spots. Overall fuzzy, background seems lighter than the foreground. Sorry for the criticisms, please don''t get discouraged. :)', '2008-06-07 12:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755865, 684692, 29009, '<td valign="top">Without the title, this shot has no story.  Next time consider including the new diaper or the child in the frame to really flesh out your concept.</td>', 'Without the title, this shot has no story.  Next time consider including the new diaper or the child in the frame to really flesh out your concept.', '2008-06-07 12:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755870, 684114, 29009, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice of background to support the overall concept.  Good use of color - very strong shot here.</td>', 'Excellent choice of background to support the overall concept.  Good use of color - very strong shot here.', '2008-06-07 12:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755871, 684639, 3020, '<td valign="top">Something seems off about this image, not sure what exactly. Interesting idea regardless.</td>', 'Something seems off about this image, not sure what exactly. Interesting idea regardless.', '2008-06-07 12:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755872, 682392, 29009, '<td valign="top">Very strong shot.  I''m not sure the negative space on either side is actually helping - it seems to distract from the imminency of the gaze.  Still, overall this should do very well.</td>', 'Very strong shot.  I''m not sure the negative space on either side is actually helping - it seems to distract from the imminency of the gaze.  Still, overall this should do very well.', '2008-06-07 12:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755873, 684736, 29009, '<td valign="top">Clever use of multiple flashes during a long exposure.  Really really nice work here.</td>', 'Clever use of multiple flashes during a long exposure.  Really really nice work here.', '2008-06-07 12:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755878, 683875, 29009, '<td valign="top">It''s a stretch to consider safety glasses a mask.  In any event, the focal point here is the actin of the glassworking rather than the mask.  I wouldn''t go so far as to say it doesn''t meet the challenge, but a different angle/perspective might have made it more a more interesting shot.  For example, looking from underneath the flame up towards the face for a tighter composition including both elements.</td>', 'It''s a stretch to consider safety glasses a mask.  In any event, the focal point here is the actin of the glassworking rather than the mask.  I wouldn''t go so far as to say it doesn''t meet the challenge, but a different angle/perspective might have made it more a more interesting shot.  For example, looking from underneath the flame up towards the face for a tighter composition including both elements.', '2008-06-07 12:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755881, 684585, 29009, '<td valign="top">Interesting facial expression.</td>', 'Interesting facial expression.', '2008-06-07 12:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755894, 683963, 29009, '<td valign="top">Ok, "censored" I get with the tape over the mouth, but the background is both distracting and does not support the message.  Whatever is happening with the textures - something just seems to be off here.  You''ve got this screaming guy...screaming about what?  Because he''s blurry and grainy for no apparent reason?  An extra point for a good try and the benefit of the doubt on working hard to achieve a message; sorry, I just feel this missed the mark.</td>', 'Ok, "censored" I get with the tape over the mouth, but the background is both distracting and does not support the message.  Whatever is happening with the textures - something just seems to be off here.  You''ve got this screaming guy...screaming about what?  Because he''s blurry and grainy for no apparent reason?  An extra point for a good try and the benefit of the doubt on working hard to achieve a message; sorry, I just feel this missed the mark.', '2008-06-07 13:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755899, 684492, 29009, '<td valign="top">Good idea to take this outside.  Perhaps trying later in the day when it''s darker and more ominous might have helped the feeling of danger.  I guess I am just not sensing danger in broad daylight?  Good use of DOF, though.  On the right track, for sure!</td>', 'Good idea to take this outside.  Perhaps trying later in the day when it''s darker and more ominous might have helped the feeling of danger.  I guess I am just not sensing danger in broad daylight?  Good use of DOF, though.  On the right track, for sure!', '2008-06-07 13:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755901, 683785, 29009, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of lines to add drama.  Toning is also well done - good strong shot here.</td>', 'Excellent use of lines to add drama.  Toning is also well done - good strong shot here.', '2008-06-07 13:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755903, 684643, 3020, '<td valign="top">Good light and contrast (notices title, lol good job), clear. I hope you didn''t worry him too much though, he looks concerned. :)</td>', 'Good light and contrast (notices title, lol good job), clear. I hope you didn''t worry him too much though, he looks concerned. :)', '2008-06-07 13:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755908, 684487, 29009, '<td valign="top">On the right track to suggest personification with the mask.  The shot isn''t quite as tack sharp as DPC voters tend to like, but the nice tight composition reinforces the sense of intimacy it appears you were trying to evoke.  While this particular shot might not do well, I see some talent here that should garner better scores in other challenges.  An extra point for encouragement!  :)</td>', 'On the right track to suggest personification with the mask.  The shot isn''t quite as tack sharp as DPC voters tend to like, but the nice tight composition reinforces the sense of intimacy it appears you were trying to evoke.  While this particular shot might not do well, I see some talent here that should garner better scores in other challenges.  An extra point for encouragement!  :)', '2008-06-07 13:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755910, 684266, 3020, '<td valign="top">Oh my, what has little red riding hood been eating? Look at those yellow teeth. I can suggest a good dentist if you are interested. Very dark and twisted, I like it. Good color and contrast. Looks like your point of focus is the mesh (cheese cloth?) and not the mask itself sadly. One thing, if this is your idea of little red riding hood I''d love to see your idea for the big bad wolf lol. :)</td>', 'Oh my, what has little red riding hood been eating? Look at those yellow teeth. I can suggest a good dentist if you are interested. Very dark and twisted, I like it. Good color and contrast. Looks like your point of focus is the mesh (cheese cloth?) and not the mask itself sadly. One thing, if this is your idea of little red riding hood I''d love to see your idea for the big bad wolf lol. :)', '2008-06-07 13:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755913, 684549, 29009, '<td valign="top">The lighting is fairly good, but doesn''t fit with the story.  For me, something is off with the hand positioning.  Have the "claws" draw blood so they serve a purpose, or in a different position to support the tears.  Right now those fingers aren''t doing anything worthy of tears.  Creative composition tho - good use of a position to suggest a diagonal line which adds more interest than a face-on shot.</td>', 'The lighting is fairly good, but doesn''t fit with the story.  For me, something is off with the hand positioning.  Have the "claws" draw blood so they serve a purpose, or in a different position to support the tears.  Right now those fingers aren''t doing anything worthy of tears.  Creative composition tho - good use of a position to suggest a diagonal line which adds more interest than a face-on shot.', '2008-06-07 13:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755917, 684229, 29009, '<td valign="top">Having the masks nailed to the tree in broad daylight suggest an interesting dichotomy of safety vs. danger, but the lighting is very harsh here.  Perhaps a different perspective might have helped - rather than straight-on -- perhaps from above to show superiority over the former danger.</td>', 'Having the masks nailed to the tree in broad daylight suggest an interesting dichotomy of safety vs. danger, but the lighting is very harsh here.  Perhaps a different perspective might have helped - rather than straight-on -- perhaps from above to show superiority over the former danger.', '2008-06-07 13:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755920, 684526, 3020, '<td valign="top">Hahaha, very funny, and very clever. Eyes are in focus, would have liked a little longer depth-of-field including the nose and chin but ah well. Love the eyes, oh damn. Not sure if humor was your goal but you met it. Good job. :)</td>', 'Hahaha, very funny, and very clever. Eyes are in focus, would have liked a little longer depth-of-field including the nose and chin but ah well. Love the eyes, oh damn. Not sure if humor was your goal but you met it. Good job. :)', '2008-06-07 13:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755924, 684606, 29009, '<td valign="top">In the end, it''s just a mask on a bunch of costume jewelry.  Take more risks!  Give the viewer something to interact with - evoke an emotion - tell a story in some way.  Color appears to be managed well, but it''s not quite as tack sharp as many DPC voters tend to like.  You''ve done well to use the mask at an angle and use composition to small benefit, but I''ll encourage you to go out on a limb next time and really think about presenting a story in an interesting way.</td>', 'In the end, it''s just a mask on a bunch of costume jewelry.  Take more risks!  Give the viewer something to interact with - evoke an emotion - tell a story in some way.  Color appears to be managed well, but it''s not quite as tack sharp as many DPC voters tend to like.  You''ve done well to use the mask at an angle and use composition to small benefit, but I''ll encourage you to go out on a limb next time and really think about presenting a story in an interesting way.', '2008-06-07 13:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755928, 684687, 29009, '<td valign="top">I''m just not seeing much here.  I think title is an important piece of overall presentation; here you''ve gone with "Naturally" yet there is nothing in the expression to support that (or vice versa) and the processing of the shot also does not support that.  Actually, I''m not sure what is going on here with the processing but IMO it''s not working.  I''m seeing a large part of the frame taken up with what could be leaves but again, they don''t look "natural."  They also don''t lead the viewer''s eye up to what I assume is your focal point, they just kind of get in the way.  An extra point, tho, for trying something new and taking some risk.</td>', 'I''m just not seeing much here.  I think title is an important piece of overall presentation; here you''ve gone with "Naturally" yet there is nothing in the expression to support that (or vice versa) and the processing of the shot also does not support that.  Actually, I''m not sure what is going on here with the processing but IMO it''s not working.  I''m seeing a large part of the frame taken up with what could be leaves but again, they don''t look "natural."  They also don''t lead the viewer''s eye up to what I assume is your focal point, they just kind of get in the way.  An extra point, tho, for trying something new and taking some risk.', '2008-06-07 13:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755929, 684598, 3020, '<td valign="top">Colorful, too much saturation in the red but as I commented on another entry not exactly uncommon. Hue/Saturation can help tone that down a bit sometimes. Interesting idea but I don''t like not being able to see their face more clearly, it is hard for my eyes to lock onto the subject.</td>', 'Colorful, too much saturation in the red but as I commented on another entry not exactly uncommon. Hue/Saturation can help tone that down a bit sometimes. Interesting idea but I don''t like not being able to see their face more clearly, it is hard for my eyes to lock onto the subject.', '2008-06-07 13:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755931, 684673, 29009, '<td valign="top">The pout isn''t really working.  The shoulder separates the viewer from the subject and appears a bit standoffish instead of evoking sympathy for the subject.</td>', 'The pout isn''t really working.  The shoulder separates the viewer from the subject and appears a bit standoffish instead of evoking sympathy for the subject.', '2008-06-07 13:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755933, 684643, 29009, '<td valign="top">Very well done - the facial expression on the child is rather priceless.  Good technicals - excellent use of toning -- a very strong shot indeed.</td>', 'Very well done - the facial expression on the child is rather priceless.  Good technicals - excellent use of toning -- a very strong shot indeed.', '2008-06-07 13:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755937, 683875, 3020, '<td valign="top">A bit of a stretch for this challenge however on an unrelated note I am glad to see him wearing darkened eye protection after the reports I''ve read of long term eye damage from glass work due to IR. I don''t think this meets the challenge however lets look at it anyway... nice job on the lighting, the flame is very clear, the glass is brilliant looking. Over all seems a little soft, especially at the top, could be a motion blur as I don''t know what shutter speed you needed to capture the flame like that. Still a nice image regardless.</td>', 'A bit of a stretch for this challenge however on an unrelated note I am glad to see him wearing darkened eye protection after the reports I''ve read of long term eye damage from glass work due to IR. I don''t think this meets the challenge however lets look at it anyway... nice job on the lighting, the flame is very clear, the glass is brilliant looking. Over all seems a little soft, especially at the top, could be a motion blur as I don''t know what shutter speed you needed to capture the flame like that. Still a nice image regardless.', '2008-06-07 13:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755938, 684678, 29009, '<td valign="top">Something about this shot just grabs me.  It has a sweet simplicity in subject matter, composition, and choice of black/white that is overall quite stunning.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Something about this shot just grabs me.  It has a sweet simplicity in subject matter, composition, and choice of black/white that is overall quite stunning.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2008-06-07 13:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755940, 684581, 29009, '<td valign="top">This made me laugh out loud - a humorous social statement about life here at DPC.</td>', 'This made me laugh out loud - a humorous social statement about life here at DPC.', '2008-06-07 13:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755944, 684570, 3020, '<td valign="top">Aww, why is she sad? That is no good. Nice job on the mask, I''ve never seen that done before. I love her eyes, very good job isolating them. The contrast or sharpening seems a bit harsh. Still very effective image, I am drawn right into her and the mask.</td>', 'Aww, why is she sad? That is no good. Nice job on the mask, I''ve never seen that done before. I love her eyes, very good job isolating them. The contrast or sharpening seems a bit harsh. Still very effective image, I am drawn right into her and the mask.', '2008-06-07 13:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755952, 684377, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not sure how you did this, but it''s awesome.  Probably my favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Not sure how you did this, but it''s awesome.  Probably my favorite of the challenge.', '2008-06-07 13:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755953, 684451, 3020, '<td valign="top">Ah more than one person had an idea like this, but I don''t mind duplicates at all. :) Lighting on her forehead and cheek seem just slightly too bright, almost to the point of washing out her features. Good clarity and color, especially on the fabric. Some minor pixelation in the upper-left of the hair. Those four white dots on the far right are distracting.</td>', 'Ah more than one person had an idea like this, but I don''t mind duplicates at all. :) Lighting on her forehead and cheek seem just slightly too bright, almost to the point of washing out her features. Good clarity and color, especially on the fabric. Some minor pixelation in the upper-left of the hair. Those four white dots on the far right are distracting.', '2008-06-07 13:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755957, 684429, 29009, '<td valign="top">I sense an attempt at humor here, but unfortunately I''m just not seeing it myself.  It looks like you dragged a dining room chair into the bathroom and shoehorned a notebook into mask duty.  What on earth the orange skin, the candles, and the silver whatevers in the background are contributing, I''m just not sure.  Ordinarily I''d hit this with a 3 and not look back, but I''m in a great mood today and giving one extra point for the benefit of the doubt and another for misguided humor because, hey, I''m not always the wittiest on the Internet either.  :)  Next time, pay particular attention to the background and how it supports your intended message.</td>', 'I sense an attempt at humor here, but unfortunately I''m just not seeing it myself.  It looks like you dragged a dining room chair into the bathroom and shoehorned a notebook into mask duty.  What on earth the orange skin, the candles, and the silver whatevers in the background are contributing, I''m just not sure.  Ordinarily I''d hit this with a 3 and not look back, but I''m in a great mood today and giving one extra point for the benefit of the doubt and another for misguided humor because, hey, I''m not always the wittiest on the Internet either.  :)  Next time, pay particular attention to the background and how it supports your intended message.', '2008-06-07 13:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755963, 682392, 30982, '<td valign="top">There''s something about the light in this that I rather like.</td>', 'There''s something about the light in this that I rather like.', '2008-06-07 13:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755966, 684528, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is just a simply stunning shot, and I''d be really surprised if it didn''t win.  Excellent use of interesting subject matter, meets the challenge spot-on, excellent use of toning/color - lots and lots of visual interest.  I hope you have this framed and in your house somewhere and in a spot of honor.  Really really nice work here; I just don''t have enough praise.</td>', 'This is just a simply stunning shot, and I''d be really surprised if it didn''t win.  Excellent use of interesting subject matter, meets the challenge spot-on, excellent use of toning/color - lots and lots of visual interest.  I hope you have this framed and in your house somewhere and in a spot of honor.  Really really nice work here; I just don''t have enough praise.', '2008-06-07 13:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755967, 684646, 30982, '<td valign="top">A lot of work went into this - very good result!</td>', 'A lot of work went into this - very good result!', '2008-06-07 13:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755968, 684644, 3020, '<td valign="top">I don''t see how this meets the challenge at all, just kidding, after 20 detailed comments a little insanity has to be expected.<br/> <br/>Good lighting and color, not completely sharp but it works because of all the smooth gradients in this shot, very simple but very effective at the same time. Nothing at all I can say against this shot. Good job!</td>', 'I don''t see how this meets the challenge at all, just kidding, after 20 detailed comments a little insanity has to be expected. Good lighting and color, not completely sharp but it works because of all the smooth gradients in this shot, very simple but very effective at the same time. Nothing at all I can say against this shot. Good job!', '2008-06-07 13:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755969, 684570, 30982, '<td valign="top">One of my top scores in this challenge - I really like the created mask - very well done.  The muted tones and her coloring work very well together.</td>', 'One of my top scores in this challenge - I really like the created mask - very well done.  The muted tones and her coloring work very well together.', '2008-06-07 13:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755971, 684534, 30982, '<td valign="top">Whimsical and delightful!</td>', 'Whimsical and delightful!', '2008-06-07 13:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755972, 684677, 30982, '<td valign="top">I very much like this - particulary the almost-sadness in the eyes.</td>', 'I very much like this - particulary the almost-sadness in the eyes.', '2008-06-07 13:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755974, 683785, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent location, and a great perspective to show it off.</td>', 'Excellent location, and a great perspective to show it off.', '2008-06-07 13:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755976, 684206, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely combination of light, shapes, textures and innocence.</td>', 'Lovely combination of light, shapes, textures and innocence.', '2008-06-07 13:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755978, 684732, 29009, '<td valign="top">It seems like you could have done a lot more with this idea.  It''s a fairly uninteresting perspective that lacks drama. There were some great colors in the masks, yet they aren''t shown off to advantage with the black background.  I suspect your title is reflective of your state of mind rather than being descriptive of the shot.  Better luck next time.</td>', 'It seems like you could have done a lot more with this idea.  It''s a fairly uninteresting perspective that lacks drama. There were some great colors in the masks, yet they aren''t shown off to advantage with the black background.  I suspect your title is reflective of your state of mind rather than being descriptive of the shot.  Better luck next time.', '2008-06-07 13:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755981, 683954, 30982, '<td valign="top">A great idea for this challenge and the lighting is quite good except for some hot spots in the red.  Then again, in this instance, "hot" spots might be quite appropriate!</td>', 'A great idea for this challenge and the lighting is quite good except for some hot spots in the red.  Then again, in this instance, "hot" spots might be quite appropriate!', '2008-06-07 13:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755983, 684447, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ewww!  And very good.</td>', 'Ewww!  And very good.', '2008-06-07 13:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755985, 684730, 3020, '<td valign="top">Well, I can say this is a very unusual entry, a bit scary almost nightmarish. It looks like it took a good deal of work in making and is an interesting idea. Sadly I''m not sure this style is quite me. Clarity seems good, lighting seems a little odd. Good contrast.</td>', 'Well, I can say this is a very unusual entry, a bit scary almost nightmarish. It looks like it took a good deal of work in making and is an interesting idea. Sadly I''m not sure this style is quite me. Clarity seems good, lighting seems a little odd. Good contrast.', '2008-06-07 13:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755990, 684581, 30982, '<td valign="top">My vote for the cheekiest entry in the challenge!  And love the fact the bag is less than clean - really adds a nice touch.</td>', 'My vote for the cheekiest entry in the challenge!  And love the fact the bag is less than clean - really adds a nice touch.', '2008-06-07 13:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755993, 684553, 29009, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the black thing in the mouth is, but it''s getting lost in the background thus confusing whatever it''s purpose was.  Good try with the composition...somehow, tho, it''s just not grabbing me.  The negative space kind of just thunks the viewers eye, and I''m not sure what you intended to convey with it.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the black thing in the mouth is, but it''s getting lost in the background thus confusing whatever it''s purpose was.  Good try with the composition...somehow, tho, it''s just not grabbing me.  The negative space kind of just thunks the viewers eye, and I''m not sure what you intended to convey with it.', '2008-06-07 13:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755995, 682325, 29009, '<td valign="top">Very sweet shot here.  I hope it''s hanging on the wall in his room!  :)  Technicals are well done, pose is excellent, and the red sneakers are just the whimsical touch that pulls the whole thing together.  Nice work.</td>', 'Very sweet shot here.  I hope it''s hanging on the wall in his room!  :)  Technicals are well done, pose is excellent, and the red sneakers are just the whimsical touch that pulls the whole thing together.  Nice work.', '2008-06-07 13:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756003, 683899, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is just some classic work - reminiscent of fine art and really truly super good.  The pose is excellent, the pattern in the background is supporting but not detracting from the focal point - this is really excellent stuff here.  I love the softness in the processing - the lighting is really really good - I really just love this overall.  Good luck in the challenge - I hope to see this on the front page once the challenge is over!</td>', 'This is just some classic work - reminiscent of fine art and really truly super good.  The pose is excellent, the pattern in the background is supporting but not detracting from the focal point - this is really excellent stuff here.  I love the softness in the processing - the lighting is really really good - I really just love this overall.  Good luck in the challenge - I hope to see this on the front page once the challenge is over!', '2008-06-07 13:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756009, 684704, 29009, '<td valign="top">Excellent work here - love the toning, the composition, and the DOF.  Very strong image indeed.</td>', 'Excellent work here - love the toning, the composition, and the DOF.  Very strong image indeed.', '2008-06-07 14:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756012, 684570, 29009, '<td valign="top">This might have been stronger done in low-key rather than high-key.  To me, sadness is better conveyed with darkness rather than light.</td>', 'This might have been stronger done in low-key rather than high-key.  To me, sadness is better conveyed with darkness rather than light.', '2008-06-07 14:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756019, 684689, 29009, '<td valign="top">With just an eye, you''ve evoked emotion and managed to convey the message.  Nicely done.  This image tells an uncomfortable story in a strong way.</td>', 'With just an eye, you''ve evoked emotion and managed to convey the message.  Nicely done.  This image tells an uncomfortable story in a strong way.', '2008-06-07 14:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756034, 684638, 29009, '<td valign="top">As you progress in your DPC career, you''ll want to pay particular attention to the background of your shots. Here, the lighting on the wall creates an unintended line that isn''t quite distracting, but it''s not helping very much.  The absence of the eyes behind the mask gives an eerie and uncomfortable feel that doesn''t go with the smile on the mask or the position of the head tilt.  I''m afraid this won''t do well, but don''t get discouraged.  You were on the right track with meeting the challenge; just some technical issues that need working out for next time.</td>', 'As you progress in your DPC career, you''ll want to pay particular attention to the background of your shots. Here, the lighting on the wall creates an unintended line that isn''t quite distracting, but it''s not helping very much.  The absence of the eyes behind the mask gives an eerie and uncomfortable feel that doesn''t go with the smile on the mask or the position of the head tilt.  I''m afraid this won''t do well, but don''t get discouraged.  You were on the right track with meeting the challenge; just some technical issues that need working out for next time.', '2008-06-07 14:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756035, 684457, 3020, '<td valign="top">I suggest switching to decaff or a faster shutter speed. Can''t make out a mask or really even the abstract idea of one. Obviously can''t see the face, lighting seems too dark, not very sharp... sorry mate, don''t give up!</td>', 'I suggest switching to decaff or a faster shutter speed. Can''t make out a mask or really even the abstract idea of one. Obviously can''t see the face, lighting seems too dark, not very sharp... sorry mate, don''t give up!', '2008-06-07 14:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756036, 683341, 29009, '<td valign="top">Very clever.</td>', 'Very clever.', '2008-06-07 14:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756037, 683692, 29009, '<td valign="top">Very powerful image.  The expression in the eyes is really quite riveting.</td>', 'Very powerful image.  The expression in the eyes is really quite riveting.', '2008-06-07 14:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756056, 684732, 3020, '<td valign="top">Is this a Mardi Gras mask? I honestly never knew so many interesting and different masks there were before this challenge. Looks a bit like a tribal wooden shield. Clear and colorful, good lighting. The isolation of the mask is very well done but I''m not sure I like the complete isolation like this.</td>', 'Is this a Mardi Gras mask? I honestly never knew so many interesting and different masks there were before this challenge. Looks a bit like a tribal wooden shield. Clear and colorful, good lighting. The isolation of the mask is very well done but I''m not sure I like the complete isolation like this.', '2008-06-07 14:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756062, 684116, 44877, '<td valign="top">The ever-popular boob mask.</td>', 'The ever-popular boob mask.', '2008-06-07 14:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756064, 684581, 44877, '<td valign="top">ha ha ha!</td>', 'ha ha ha!', '2008-06-07 14:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756072, 684606, 60505, '<td valign="top">needs clearer focus</td>', 'needs clearer focus', '2008-06-07 14:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756073, 684528, 60505, '<td valign="top">would have preferred eyes to be in focus even if the theme is mask!Like the composition</td>', 'would have preferred eyes to be in focus even if the theme is mask!Like the composition', '2008-06-07 14:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756075, 684451, 60505, '<td valign="top">would have liked a little more definition in the light side of the nose. Love the fabric, may have cropped the hair out altogether</td>', 'would have liked a little more definition in the light side of the nose. Love the fabric, may have cropped the hair out altogether', '2008-06-07 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756076, 682335, 60505, '<td valign="top">"red eye" not acceptable here, pity because the color composition and contrasts are cool.</td>', '"red eye" not acceptable here, pity because the color composition and contrasts are cool.', '2008-06-07 14:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756077, 684687, 60505, '<td valign="top">leaves a little too confusing</td>', 'leaves a little too confusing', '2008-06-07 14:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756079, 684225, 60505, '<td valign="top">I like the graphic rendition, but would like to crop more from the photo as it appears to add little</td>', 'I like the graphic rendition, but would like to crop more from the photo as it appears to add little', '2008-06-07 14:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756080, 684737, 60505, '<td valign="top">nice clean lines here, but I may have cropped out more and concentrate on the lines of and in the mask as that is where the interest lies. The top of the snorkel is not that interesting and leads the eye away from the center of interest.</td>', 'nice clean lines here, but I may have cropped out more and concentrate on the lines of and in the mask as that is where the interest lies. The top of the snorkel is not that interesting and leads the eye away from the center of interest.', '2008-06-07 14:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756082, 684704, 60505, '<td valign="top">interesting, but eye is too central</td>', 'interesting, but eye is too central', '2008-06-07 14:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756083, 684644, 60505, '<td valign="top">beautiful hands too.framing is great. lighting from below reveals a beautiful aspect and twist of mask adds drama to the composition</td>', 'beautiful hands too.framing is great. lighting from below reveals a beautiful aspect and twist of mask adds drama to the composition', '2008-06-07 14:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756084, 684583, 60505, '<td valign="top">eyes are super, but make up is a bit uneven and detracts from the eyes. nice lighting</td>', 'eyes are super, but make up is a bit uneven and detracts from the eyes. nice lighting', '2008-06-07 14:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756085, 684680, 60505, '<td valign="top">love the leather</td>', 'love the leather', '2008-06-07 14:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756087, 684597, 60505, '<td valign="top">her R eye looks unreal to me and detracts from her beautiful L one.</td>', 'her R eye looks unreal to me and detracts from her beautiful L one.', '2008-06-07 14:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756088, 682325, 60505, '<td valign="top">very cute and still scores high!</td>', 'very cute and still scores high!', '2008-06-07 14:59:43.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4756089, 684646, 60505, '<td valign="top">interesting</td>', 'interesting', '2008-06-07 15:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756090, 683341, 60505, '<td valign="top">good execution of concept, though would like to have had neck covered also</td>', 'good execution of concept, though would like to have had neck covered also', '2008-06-07 15:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756117, 684581, 47852, '<td valign="top">Cute!  A bit of editing visible in the white background, but the idea is cute :)</td>', 'Cute!  A bit of editing visible in the white background, but the idea is cute :)', '2008-06-07 15:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756227, 684597, 82064, '<td valign="top">I think it would have had more impact without the effects in the veil - the other eye is distracting to me.</td>', 'I think it would have had more impact without the effects in the veil - the other eye is distracting to me.', '2008-06-07 16:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756228, 684447, 61396, '<td valign="top">Ouch! Your efforts to scare me paid off.</td>', 'Ouch! Your efforts to scare me paid off.', '2008-06-07 16:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756235, 684523, 82064, '<td valign="top">I like the way you positioned your subject, the circles and lines, black and white - really nice! 10</td>', 'I like the way you positioned your subject, the circles and lines, black and white - really nice! 10', '2008-06-07 16:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756292, 683954, 93756, '<td valign="top">Great concept!</td>', 'Great concept!', '2008-06-07 17:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756294, 684504, 93756, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually like the scary photos, but this one is great. Lock your doors!</td>', 'I don''t usually like the scary photos, but this one is great. Lock your doors!', '2008-06-07 17:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756295, 684604, 93756, '<td valign="top">lol - my kids wanted to do this and I said no. They love the photo and are wrapping themselves in painters'' tape as we speak!</td>', 'lol - my kids wanted to do this and I said no. They love the photo and are wrapping themselves in painters'' tape as we speak!', '2008-06-07 17:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756298, 683880, 93756, '<td valign="top">Love the title and the concept, but the blacks and whites aren''t working. Too much graininess in the white wall and the mask is a different black from the bedpost. Might have been better in color with a colored bedspread and a lighter toned post.</td>', 'Love the title and the concept, but the blacks and whites aren''t working. Too much graininess in the white wall and the mask is a different black from the bedpost. Might have been better in color with a colored bedspread and a lighter toned post.', '2008-06-07 17:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756303, 684429, 93756, '<td valign="top">lol - tough challenge?</td>', 'lol - tough challenge?', '2008-06-07 17:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756359, 684206, 61396, '<td valign="top">Pretty and crisp as silk</td>', 'Pretty and crisp as silk', '2008-06-07 18:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756360, 683692, 61396, '<td valign="top">I like the way you conveyed the fragility of the girl. Great work.</td>', 'I like the way you conveyed the fragility of the girl. Great work.', '2008-06-07 18:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756362, 683954, 61396, '<td valign="top">Great setup, great lighting, great title, great job.</td>', 'Great setup, great lighting, great title, great job.', '2008-06-07 18:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756363, 684528, 61396, '<td valign="top">It''s great how the girl skin, eyes and hair colors all find a match in the mask.</td>', 'It''s great how the girl skin, eyes and hair colors all find a match in the mask.', '2008-06-07 18:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756364, 684570, 61396, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty unique mask and a processing to match it. The leaves and eyes play together nicely.</td>', 'That''s pretty unique mask and a processing to match it. The leaves and eyes play together nicely.', '2008-06-07 18:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756365, 684266, 61396, '<td valign="top">Looks like the hunter arrived too late in your version of the story.</td>', 'Looks like the hunter arrived too late in your version of the story.', '2008-06-07 18:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756366, 684691, 61396, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting to a pretty subject.</td>', 'Lovely lighting to a pretty subject.', '2008-06-07 18:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756367, 684492, 61396, '<td valign="top">Pretty scary. I like how the viewing point and setup support the notion of hiding.</td>', 'Pretty scary. I like how the viewing point and setup support the notion of hiding.', '2008-06-07 18:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756368, 684114, 61396, '<td valign="top">I like the dark scary mood, and the 3D effect created by the forground and background bokeh. The noise and the highlights resulting from the reflected flash let the picture down a bit.</td>', 'I like the dark scary mood, and the 3D effect created by the forground and background bokeh. The noise and the highlights resulting from the reflected flash let the picture down a bit.', '2008-06-07 18:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756370, 684451, 61396, '<td valign="top">Simple and neat. The skin highlights is less appealing to me.</td>', 'Simple and neat. The skin highlights is less appealing to me.', '2008-06-07 18:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756460, 684528, 23098, '<td valign="top">Great mask, colors and shot.  Looks like a winner to me.</td>', 'Great mask, colors and shot.  Looks like a winner to me.', '2008-06-07 19:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756465, 684114, 23098, '<td valign="top">The mask, setting, colors -- really cool shot.</td>', 'The mask, setting, colors -- really cool shot.', '2008-06-07 19:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756472, 684589, 23098, '<td valign="top">Dramatic, the stealthy feeling comes through.</td>', 'Dramatic, the stealthy feeling comes through.', '2008-06-07 19:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756475, 684266, 23098, '<td valign="top">She looks different! Good one.</td>', 'She looks different! Good one.', '2008-06-07 19:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756477, 684447, 23098, '<td valign="top">Wow -- gruesome. Looks almost real.  Nice work.</td>', 'Wow -- gruesome. Looks almost real.  Nice work.', '2008-06-07 19:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756478, 684684, 23098, '<td valign="top">Great colors. Good one.</td>', 'Great colors. Good one.', '2008-06-07 19:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756482, 684644, 23098, '<td valign="top">I like the color tones and comp.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I like the color tones and comp.  Nicely done.', '2008-06-07 19:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756483, 684451, 23098, '<td valign="top">Dramatic. I like the light and tones - nice work.</td>', 'Dramatic. I like the light and tones - nice work.', '2008-06-07 19:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756542, 684114, 88136, '<td valign="top">lol love the color, very nice photo-7</td>', 'lol love the color, very nice photo-7', '2008-06-07 19:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756543, 684737, 88136, '<td valign="top">lol funny</td>', 'lol funny', '2008-06-07 19:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
