(4758752, 684589, 88054, '<td valign="top">This should have scored much higher. Apparently some of these folks don''t know how a jungle sniper lives...He is supposed to be dark and stealthy. I love the way the face fades into black on the right side of the frame. This is near perfect in my opinion. Keep up the good work and thank you for your contribution to our country.</td>', 'This should have scored much higher. Apparently some of these folks don''t know how a jungle sniper lives...He is supposed to be dark and stealthy. I love the way the face fades into black on the right side of the frame. This is near perfect in my opinion. Keep up the good work and thank you for your contribution to our country.', '2008-06-09 01:18:44.000000', NULL, 0);
