(4811312, 684689, 53572, '<td valign="top"><br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg"/></a> wow.  the colours in this, the shallow focus, the deep tones, all work so well together.  i love the way the eyelets and the eye have equal visual weight.  ooo, yeah, baby...</td>', ' wow.  the colours in this, the shallow focus, the deep tones, all work so well together.  i love the way the eyelets and the eye have equal visual weight.  ooo, yeah, baby...', '2008-07-08 07:56:04.000000', NULL, 0),
