(4891467, 684590, 60862, '<td valign="top">How did I not comment on this yet?<br/> <br/>I think the concept is wonderful, but you lost a little impact because the left side of the image fades into the background.  Try either shining light on the background so it''s brighter than the pure black subject or have a light behind you shining forward so you get a halo on your hair.  Heh - do I sound like I know what I''m talking about with lighting?  THAT''ll be the day. :)</td>', 'How did I not comment on this yet? I think the concept is wonderful, but you lost a little impact because the left side of the image fades into the background.  Try either shining light on the background so it''s brighter than the pure black subject or have a light behind you shining forward so you get a halo on your hair.  Heh - do I sound like I know what I''m talking about with lighting?  THAT''ll be the day. :)', '2008-08-16 02:00:05.000000', NULL, 0),
