(5845378, 684377, 113900, '<td valign="top">Just saw this image posted in the "who farted?" thread. Wow, very good photo. It''s creepy and leaves the viewer with a lingering feeling of dread, my photos do that accidentily but I think that is the intent with this one. Nice work.</td>', 'Just saw this image posted in the "who farted?" thread. Wow, very good photo. It''s creepy and leaves the viewer with a lingering feeling of dread, my photos do that accidentily but I think that is the intent with this one. Nice work.', '2010-01-31 14:10:53.000000', NULL, 0),
