(6133045, 683938, 37845, '<td valign="top">I see that you did a remake of this shot:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=901509" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/46918/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_901509.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/46918/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_901509.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/45000-49999/46918/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_901509.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>While both photos are good, I prefer the original edit much better. The subject matter, and title, beg the viewer to consider what the building is/was used for. Was it a sniper tower?  Or just another architectural casualty of war?  Unfortunately, the idea behind the photo is too abstract for many challenge it was in. I say unfortunate, because this photo certainly did not deserve brown.</td>', 'I see that you did a remake of this shot:  While both photos are good, I prefer the original edit much better. The subject matter, and title, beg the viewer to consider what the building is/was used for. Was it a sniper tower?  Or just another architectural casualty of war?  Unfortunately, the idea behind the photo is too abstract for many challenge it was in. I say unfortunate, because this photo certainly did not deserve brown.', '2010-08-17 18:24:15.000000', NULL, 0),
